B.aNC=new A.aZ("Ikhfa (concealment)","A noon with sukoon or tanween before one of the fifteen ikhfa letters is pronounced between clear and merged, with ghunnah.","Neither say the noon fully nor merge it; keep it light with two counts of ghunnah.")
